<title>UK: Cofidis sets 500 mln French franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cofidis sets 500 mln French franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COFIDIS</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.10 PCT  MATURITY    23.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.20    PAY DATE    23.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    98.98     SPREAD	+43 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 5	   YIELD	 6.24 PCT</p>
<p> MGT/UND    90 BP     SELL CONC  80 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 6.50 PCT 2006 AND 8.5 PCT</p>
<p>			    2008 OATS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
